    <h2>Tank vs. tankless in a Richardson garage closet</h2>
    <p>Many Richardson homes from the 1960s-70s boom have a compact garage or hallway water heater closet sized for a standard tank, and switching to tankless can reclaim that space, though it usually requires upgraded gas line sizing and venting. Get quotes for both before deciding.</p>
